IBM DATA SERVER DRIVER FOR JDBC AND SQLJ (JCC)
----------------------------------------------
No IBM driver is distributed with this project. The IBM Data Server Driver
for JDBC and SQLJ is declared at `test` scope and is explicitly excluded
from the repackaged application archive; it must be supplied by the operator
and used under IBM's own terms. See docs/operations/external-jdbc-driver.md.
